      "question": "Read the extract and answer the questions.\n\n*'Never shall a young man,*\n*Thrown into despair*\n*By those great honey-coloured*\n*Ramparts at your ear,'*\n\n(i) Who speaks these lines?\n\n(ii) To whom?\n\n(iii) What are 'honey-coloured ramparts'?\n\n(iv) Why are young men in despair?\n\n(v) Name the device in 'honey-coloured ramparts'.",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "answer_steps": [
        "(i) The poet.",
        "(ii) Anne Gregory.",
        "(iii) Her yellow hair.",
        "(iv) They are hopelessly in love with her beauty.",
        "(v) Metaphor."
      ],
      "marking_scheme": [
        "(i) 1 mark",
        "(ii) 1 mark",
